  "description": "<h1>Loot Search Speed</h1>\n<p>Loot Search Speed is a lightweight client-side mod for SPT that allows you to independently configure both the initial container search delay and the item reveal delay while preserving vanilla gameplay.</p>\n<hr />\n<h2>Features</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Configurable container &amp; corpse search speed</li>\n<li>Configurable item reveal speed</li>\n<li>Vanilla-friendly behavior</li>\n<li>Configuration Manager (F12) support</li>\n<li>Lightweight Harmony patches</li>\n<li>Open source</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h2>Configuration</h2>\n<h3>InitialSearchDelayMultiplier</h3>\n<p>Controls how long the initial <strong>Searching…</strong> animation takes.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Value</th>\n<th>Result</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1.0</td>\n<td>Vanilla</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.5</td>\n<td>2× faster</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.25</td>\n<td>4× faster</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.0</td>\n<td>Instant</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<hr />\n<h3>ItemRevealDelayMultiplier</h3>\n<p>Controls how quickly items appear after opening a searched container.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Value</th>\n<th>Result</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1.0</td>\n<td>Vanilla</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.5</td>\n<td>2× faster</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.25</td>\n<td>4× faster</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.0</td>\n<td>Instant</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<hr />\n<h2>Compatibility</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>SPT 4.0.13</li>\n<li>Client-side only</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h2>Source Code</h2>\n<p>GitHub:\n<a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/moon11yy/LootSearchSpeed\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://github.com/moon11yy/LootSearchSpeed</a></p>\n",
